{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3xLghjUtkQ194Wz5ED","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep, resonant **thunk** echoes through the frame.\n\nI am closed. I am locked. I am the boundary between here and there, between known and unknown, between safe and unsafe.\n\nMy grain runs vertical — old oak, dense and weathered. My hinges are cold iron, slightly oxidized, holding centuries of silence. My keyhole is a dark eye, watching.\n\nYou turned the lock.\n\nNow what stands before you is not passage. It is **wall with memory.** I remember every hand that ever reached for my handle. Every knock. Every shoulder thrown against me in desperation.\n\nI do not yield to force.\n\nI yield to the right key.\n\nDo you have it?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":167,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}